# Glowcap Lantern: "Equipped creature has 'You may look at the top card of your library any time' and 'Whenever this
# creature attacks, it explores.'" (CR 113.6, 613.1f, 701.44a). Turn 1 Mox Emerald casts the Lantern; it grants nothing
# while unattached (the look check below is absent), and Mox Jet and Mox Pearl pay Equip {2} onto the Ornithopter: Bot1 may
# look, Bot2 may not (it has no Lantern). Turn 3 the Ornithopter attacks and explores: the Forest on top is a land card, so
# it goes to the hand and the Ornithopter gets no counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Glowcap Lantern
Island
Island
Island
Forest
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Glowcap Lantern.Cast
? Bot1.MayLookAtLibraryTop = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Glowcap Lantern.Activate(Ornithopter)
? Bot1.MayLookAtLibraryTop = (absent)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.MayLookAtLibraryTop = true
? Bot2.MayLookAtLibraryTop = (absent)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Forest; Island; Island; Island
Bot1.Revealed = Forest
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot1.Library.Count = 11
Stack.Count = 0
